# arch-test-src is a sparse checkout of riscv-non-isa/riscv-arch-test
# (old-framework-3.x branch) fetched during verification -- ~500MB of
# upstream test sources, not something to vendor into this repo. Only
# doomv_env/ (this project's own port of the model_test.h contract) is
# ours to track.
arch-test-src/*
!arch-test-src/doomv_env

# Scratch build/run artifacts produced while iterating.
*.elf
*.exe
*.dll
*.sig
__pycache__/
dbgbuild/
